<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Security Capital raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Security Capital raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber upgraded Security Capital Pacific Trust to attractive from neutral, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 to 24-1/2.</p>
